Run the 9.2 trace-inject gate: prove the host stamps `traceparent` on both the P2 and P3 outbound surfaces, read back from serve-echo

Usage: wamn-gates traceproof [OPTIONS] --upstream <UPSTREAM>

Options:
      --log-level <LOG_LEVEL>      Log level (the Jobs pass this before the subcommand) [default: info]
      --upstream <UPSTREAM>        Reflecting upstream in a separate process/pod
      --result-file <RESULT_FILE>  Write the completed assertions as JSON, including to a Kubernetes termination file
  -h, --help                       Print help
